#: main.cpp:44
msgid "KDE Crash Handler gives the user feedback if a program crashed."
msgstr ""
"Li KDE Crash Handler waite di splikî cwè a l' ûzeu si on programe a "
"tcheyou an rak."

#: main.cpp:48
msgid "The signal number we caught."
msgstr "Li limerô di signå apicî."

#: main.cpp:49
msgid "Name of the program."
msgstr "Li no do programe."

#: main.cpp:50
