#: backtrace.cpp:75
msgid ""
"%1 not found. Check if it is installed -- you need it to generate "
"backtraces.\n"
"If you have another debugger, contact kde-devel@kde.org for help on how to "
"set it up."
msgstr ""
"Dji n' a nén trové %1. Waitîz s' il est bén astalé -- vos nd avoz "
"mezåjhe po-z ahîver des backtraces.\n"
"Si vs avoz en ôte disbogueu, atôchîz kde-devel@kde.org por vos avu on "
"côp d' mwin po l' apontyî."

